  "notes": "Connector frame wiring for M611/M611A, viewed from rear of frame. P1 = mains: AC input (M611 115 V AC 60 Hz, M611A 230 V AC 50 Hz) on P1-16 and P1-7; a dashed 'See Notes' link from P1-6 to P1-4. Notes 1/2: conditional strap pin 6 to pin 5/4/3 for 125/115/105 V (M611) or 250/230/210 V (M611A); the notes do not name the connector, read as P1 from the dashed link. P2 = outputs: +V on 10 and -V on 2 (labelled together '20V UNREGULATED'), 5-8 linked to +12V UNREGULATED, 13-16 linked to 12V COMM, 12 to chassis ground. Remaining contacts drawn unwired. Note P1's left column is 1-8 and P2's left column is 9-16 as drawn."
